Z||000006||Mach10||09-15-2001||07:17 PM||||Both, side-by-side. I can't read arabic (yet) and the translation is almost literal. It was done by some university professors.<BR>When I get home, I'll send you the link. <BR>It's neat. Every second line is "Allah is most merciful."<P>From what I'm gathering, Islam is about "We are the only way" but that peace and charity is the good path. Allah will deal with everything else.<P>One interesting thing to note is that passages in Islam state that if you are attacked, then you are free to retaliate to the death. If your opponent withdraws, then unless the person is a sinner, you are encouraged to drop your attack also. It also notes that you may continue to retaliate against that opponent if he attacks on religious areas, or if he is actively sinning. <P>It's neat.||||reg||1
